<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE -- College District 536, Ill..</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE -- College District 536, Ill..</headline>
<text>
<p>COMMUNITY COLLEGE DISTRICT 536</p>
<p>RE: $6,700,000</p>
<p>COUNTIES OF MADISON, JERSEY, MACOUPON, CALHOUN,</p>
<p>MORGAN, SCOTT &amp; GREENE &amp; STATE OF ILLINOIS</p>
